## Weak points for the reviewer

- The brush grip band is a raised ring with a painted colour. The paint region is
  a cylinder of radius 0.015 m, so a thin ring of the handle above and below the
  band can read as part of the band.
- The paint pot shows faint vertical streaks on the cream wall. They come from the
  mesh grid, and the inherited build showed the same streaks.
- The kite keeps the inspect warning "the side silhouette is very thin". The brief
  allows a 14 mm sail.
- The paint pot ear is small. It reads in the front view and hides in the side
  view.
- The paint pot is a mound, not a flat pool. The owner may want a flat pool that
  sits deeper in the cup.

